Did you remember to press the space bar to turn him on?

OK.  Here's what I would do if I could.  I'd push Dusty's button
until it shows E for erase, 
pick him up, and press the space bar.  I'd move Dusty over
the number and then set Dusty down.  And then I'd pick up the blank number.

